        "widgetNotes": {
          "equipment": {
            "root": {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "detail": 0,
                      "format": 0,
                      "mode": "normal",
                      "style": "",
                      "text": "Welcome to my Flicker Blood Mage build for D4...I know its weird but here we are...we have a dark mage in D4 not a warlock. With the addition of Enigma has opened it up for all classes to feel like a teleporting sorcerer. This build was into T12 content with only 1 eliminator glyph installed at level 60. That's right, once you have the unique's in place with the right stats and tempers, you can go straight to endgame farming! I was surprised at the sheer power of the build from setup into endgame grinding and has become my favorite build of the season. Many of you watching me play POE2 know how much I like the blood mage and too have this in D4 is an absolute dream for me <3 <3 You need any help with this...gear farming, setup, or just want to say hi, you can find me live almost every night at 11pm EST at twitch.tv/redrankmuppet ...Gameplay loop is pretty simple...we hold down bloodwave while teleporting around...while teleporting around we collect blood orbs created by bloodwave that stack our overpower charges giving us big damage with overpower stacks. Overpower stacks max is increased by our boots and ammy putting us upwards of 12 overpower stacks! Harder enemies we hit with decrepify and we stand inside our bone prison. Yes, WE stand in the prison...this gives us huge essence regen kicking up over 500 essence per SECOND and massive attack speed turning us into a blood wave gatling gun!!! ",
                      "type": "text",
                      "version": 1
                    }
                  ],
                  "direction": "ltr",
                  "format": "",
                  "indent": 0,
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "version": 1
                }
              ],
              "direction": "ltr",
              "format": "",
              "indent": 0,
              "type": "root",
              "version": 1
            }
          }
